</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3b33760e-7f9a-11f1-b640-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Iran-USA-13072026.png"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3b33760e-7f9a-11f1-b640-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Iran-USA-13072026.png" type="image/png" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">1c76f84c-8087-11f1-ad8d-75fe1101079b</guid><pubDate>Wed, 15 Jul 2026 19:55:29 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/3b33760e-7f9a-11f1-b640-005056a97e36/w:1024/p:16x9/Iran-USA-13072026.png">© CENTCOM</source><dc:creator>左依</dc:creator></item><item><category>要闻分析</category><title>美军连续第5天打击伊朗 也门青年运动威胁关闭曼德海峡</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E4%B8%93%E6%A0%8F%E6%A3%80%E7%B4%A2/%E8%A6%81%E9%97%BB%E5%88%86%E6%9E%90/20260715-%E7%BE%8E%E5%86%9B%E8%BF%9E%E7%BB%AD%E7%AC%AC5%E5%A4%A9%E6%89%93%E5%87%BB%E4%BC%8A%E6%9C%97-%E4%B9%9F%E9%97%A8%E9%9D%92%E5%B9%B4%E8%BF%90%E5%8A%A8%E5%A8%81%E8%83%81%E5%85%B3%E9%97%AD%E6%9B%BC%E5%BE%B7%E6%B5%B7%E5%B3%A1</link><description>
